Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:07.20,Burn,,0,0,0,,6:00 AM — we open the farmhouse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:12.35,Burn,,0,0,0,,First steps on the red-earth path
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:18.35,Burn,,0,0,0,,The goshala. Ganga is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:24.35,Burn,,0,0,0,,Ganga — Hallikar, eleven years with us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:32.35,Burn,,0,0,0,,Fodder first. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.95,0:00:40.35,Burn,,0,0,0,,Between the tomato rows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.95,0:00:48.35,Burn,,0,0,0,,Water slow — down to the roots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.95,0:00:54.20,Burn,,0,0,0,,One acre. One morning. Our world.
